IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-BLANK-INFILL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 D1-MASKED-SPAN.
   05 D1-PRE-NONCE-SEED    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
   05 D1-POST-PARITY-BIT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-TARGET-ADDR       PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-INFILLED-WORD.
   05 D2-INFILLED-OPCODE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-INFILLED-ADDR     PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
   05 D2-INFILLED-MOD      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-RAW-32BIT-WORD    PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.

    PERFORM INFILL-MASKED-INSTRUCTION-SPAN.
    PERFORM VERIFY-POST-CONDITION-PARITY.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D2-INFILLED-OPCODE == 65 AND D2-INFILLED-ADDR == D1-TARGET-ADDR
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 2 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

INFILL-MASKED-INSTRUCTION-SPAN.
    comment GLM Bidirectional Infilling: Synthesizing Op='A' (65) and short modifier 0;
    MOVE 65 TO D2-INFILLED-OPCODE.
    MOVE D1-TARGET-ADDR TO D2-INFILLED-ADDR.
    MOVE 0 TO D2-INFILLED-MOD.
    COMPUTE D2-RAW-32BIT-WORD = (D2-INFILLED-OPCODE * 16777216) + (D2-INFILLED-ADDR * 4) + D2-INFILLED-MOD.
    EXIT.

VERIFY-POST-CONDITION-PARITY.
    comment Assert Parity Alignment across Infilled Span;
    COMPUTE D1-POST-PARITY-BIT = (D2-INFILLED-OPCODE + D2-INFILLED-ADDR + D2-INFILLED-MOD) - 
        (((D2-INFILLED-OPCODE + D2-INFILLED-ADDR + D2-INFILLED-MOD) / 2) * 2).
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-RAW-32BIT-WORD - ((D2-RAW-32BIT-WORD / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
